  "details": "Have already made a canny here not knowing the exact issue: \nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/bug-safety-setting-for-shader-not-completly-working\nToday during testing we found out, that an animation that changes the material is not covered by the safety settings. Meaning if shaders off and animations on, an avatar can ignore the \"shaders off\" setting.\nIncluding a screen of the Animationlayer. As well as \"before\" and \"after\" animation screenshots from within the game. White box is censoring a logo with name on it in case you wonder.",
